# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc8.rpy:548
translate brazil ch6sc8_2a60c24d:

#   uk "Come now, what harm could it do to reveal our ways to them? They’re our captives now."
    uk "Ora, que mal faria revelar-lhes os nossos métodos? Agora eles são nossos prisioneiros."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc8.rpy:549
translate brazil ch6sc8_a2dc3cf9:

#   uk "Outsiders, the huts and towers you see here are just for ease of use."
    uk "Para quem não conhece, as cabanas e torres que vocês veem aqui servem apenas para facilitar o acesso."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc8.rpy:550
translate brazil ch6sc8_5f97f16f:

