translate brazil ch6sc8_6c58e7e4:

#   riv "This pleases me, come to my personal chambers in one hour… [mc]."
    riv "Isso me agrada, venha aos meus aposentos particulares daqui a uma hora… [mc]."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc8.rpy:1983
translate brazil ch6sc8_e69e68fb:

#   mc "I’ll see you in one hour then."
    mc "Te vejo daqui a uma hora, então."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc8.rpy:1985
translate brazil ch6sc8_377f4362:

#   "As Riven takes her leave, you head over to talk to the huntresses."
